 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Of course. That's thoughtful of her. Do you want something easy, so she can help or something complex for a special night? Ask her. A few simple questions would give you good idea. Does she want the full gluten free menu all the time, or just at home? Oats, rice, and potatoes are the biggest ones. Some fruit with the skin removed. Some legumes and seeds. There' a long list of them, but they're not all that common. Sorry, soy sauce is out. There are hummus and tahini, though. You could make dip together and have a soy sauce free night. It is when you' used to thinking about it all the time. Not forever, just for her. And you can still have it for her.",
